        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Toyota Pickup, Toyota Hilux, Toyota Fortuner\n- Companies: Toyota\n- Concepts: Toyota War, IMV platform\n\nFacts:\n- The Toyota War is primarily named after the Toyota pickup truck.\n- Toyota retired the \"Toyota Pickup\" name in North America in 1976.\n- The pickup truck associated with the Toyota War is part of Toyota's IMV collection.\n- The Toyota Fortuner SUV is also part of Toyota's IMV collection.",
